ype":"text","value":"1分\n（2）①由动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"mgR = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{B2}^2 - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"1分 可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B2} = 10\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"由动量守恒定律"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{B2} = (M + m)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分 可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}} = 5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"由能量守恒定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E_{\\text{机}} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{B2}^2 - \\frac{1}{2}(M + m)v_{\\text{共}}^2 = 12.5\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n②由上面的结果推理可知，当滑块在 A 点静止释放，恰好在离平板左端的 2/3L 处达到共速，同时平板的运动距离"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{平}}=\\frac{v_{\\text{共}}}{2}\\cdot\\frac{v_{\\text{共}}}{\\mu g}=2.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"，由此可知，平板刚好与挡板接触。因此，在 A 点以下释放将一定会与平板共速，且共速时平板还将运动一段距离，当平板到达挡板并被锁定后，滑块继续滑动，可能会从 E 点飞出。\n设滑块与平板共速时的相对平板的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"根据"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{B3}^2 - 0"},{"type":"math","value":"m v _ {B 3} = (M + m) v _ {\\text{共}} ^ {'}"},{"type":"math","value":"- \\mu m g \\cdot \\Delta x = \\frac {1}{2} (M + m) v _ {\\text{共}} ^ {' 2} - \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {B 3} ^ {2}"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {E} ^ {2} - v _ {\\text{共}} ^ {' 2} = 2 \\cdot (- \\mu g) \\cdot (\\frac {2}{3} L - \\Delta x)"},{"type":"text","value":"(全过程能量守恒方程也正确)"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{飞}}=v_{E}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\frac{2h}{g}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分 可得"},{"type":"math","value":"h=\\frac{4x_{\\text{飞}}^{2}+50}{15}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n因为"},{"type":"math","value":"1\\mathrm{m}\\leq x_{\\text{飞}}\\leq 2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以"},{"type":"math","value":"3.6\\mathrm{m}\\leq h\\leq 4.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"97863ca8b34cf31b6247033f9daa1691c3c1c18e2eaae90a7313d74b464833fe","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. 如图所示，顶角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"74^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的等腰“<”形光滑金属轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"MON"},{"type":"text","value":" 与足够长的平行光滑金属轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"MP"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"NQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":" 处用绝缘材料平滑连接，两金属轨道间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，右端连一电容为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.25\\mathrm{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电容器，整个装置水平放置，固定在方向竖直向下，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{1}{3}\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场中。现有一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.15\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，长也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的金属棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中点与 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点重合，如图放置，在水平外力作用下沿“<”形角平分线方向以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 0.2\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的恒定速度在轨道上滑动。金属棒与“<”形轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"MON"},{"type":"text","value":" 的单位长度电阻均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{0} = 0.125\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计其他电阻， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 。从金属棒开始滑动时计时，求：\n（1）0.5s 时刻，流过金属棒的电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小及方向；\n（2）金属棒运动 2s 时，整个电路产生的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）当金属棒滑过 MN 位置时，撤去外力，求金属棒在轨道上的最终速度 v；\n（4）若金属棒滑动 1s 后，撤去外力，求金属棒最终停的位置。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ca6f1b48e20e4fbcda6137b752f124150f8951c2e20bbb75691d120aaa09687b.png","width":897,"height":407,"width_mm":105.481,"row_group":"xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第19题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19 题\n答案：（1）0.2A 逆时针方向（b 指向 a ） （2）0.008J （3）0.15m/s （4）金属棒最终停在 MN 位置\n解析：\n（1）0.5s 时刻，金属棒的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x = v_{0}t = 0.1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，金属棒切割磁感线的长度"},{"type":"math","value":"l = \\frac{3x}{2} = 0.15\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n则此时金属棒的电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E = Blv_{0} = 0.01V"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n回路中的总电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\text{总}}=4xr_{0}=0.05\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"所以金属棒的电流大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{E}{R_{\\text{总}}} = 0.2\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n方向为逆时针方向（b 指向 a）1 分\n（2）t 时刻，整个回路的电功率"},{"type":"math","value":"P = I^{2} R_{\\text{总}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，而 I = 0.2A，\n整个回路电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{\\text{总}} = 4v_{0}tr_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"P \\propto t"},{"type":"text","value":"因此"},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{P} = I^2\\overline{R_{\\text{总}}} = I^2\\frac{R_{\\text{总}}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，1分 故"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\overline{P} t = 0.008\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（3）金属棒滑上平行金属轨道的，对电容器充电，由动量定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"BLq = mv_{0} - mv"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n而"},{"type":"math","value":"q = CU"},{"type":"text","value":"，由于金属棒电压与电容器两端电压相等，故"},{"type":"math","value":"U = BLv"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n三式联立，最终速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{mv_0}{m + CB^2L^2} = 0.15\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（4）t=1s 时金属棒运动到"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"位置，此时刻杆长"},{"type":"math","value":"l_{0}=0.3m"},{"type":"text","value":"，在运动到 MN 前，取无数段时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"，某时刻杆长为 l，\n回路中电阻为"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\left(l + \\frac{l}{\\sin 37^\\circ}\\right)r_0"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B^2l^2v\\cdot\\Delta t}{R} = m\\cdot \\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B^2\\Delta S}{(1 + \\frac{1}{sin37^\\circ})r_0} = m\\cdot \\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_{0}-\\frac{B^{2}(l_{0}+x\\tan37^{\\circ})x}{m(1+\\frac{1}{sin37^{\\circ}})r_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n当杆运行至 MN 时，即 x=0.2m，代入数据得 v=0，故金属棒最终停在 MN 位置。"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412","source_question_id":"xianyu-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2412-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4ea985d45e6fd7a202139755b9ee5b06c4d2024be00fbf8c8e7dc626a06bee78","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面内存在如图所示的有界匀强磁场区域，磁场上边界是以 "},{"type":"math","value":"O^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" （0，4r）为圆心，半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1} = 5r"},{"type":"text","value":" 的一段优弧，磁场下边界是以 "},{"type":"math","value":"O(0,0)"},{"type":"text","value":" 为圆心、半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2} = 3r"},{"type":"text","value":" 的半圆弧，两段圆弧都与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴交于 "},{"type":"math","value":"P(-3r,0)"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"S(3r,0)"},{"type":"text","value":" 两点，分别与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴交于 "},{"type":"math","value":"M(0,9r)"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"N(0,3r)"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现有一平行于 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的线状电子源 "},{"type":"math","value":"GF"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其上端与 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 点对齐，下端与 "},{"type":"math","value":"O^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点对齐，沿直线 "},{"type":"math","value":"GF"},{"type":"text","value":" 均匀分布的电子持续不断地以 "},{"type":"math","value":"5v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的速率沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向射出，每秒射出的电子数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" 。在磁场区域的正下方 "},